stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> JUMP_PLACED : Workflow Manager spawns
    JUMP_PLACED --> MONITORING : Order Submitted

    MONITORING --> CANCELLED : Event wall_disappeared or Timeout
    MONITORING --> FILLED : Event order_filled

    FILLED --> EXIT_STRATEGY : Place TP and Monitor Wall

    EXIT_STRATEGY --> BAILOUT : Event wall_disappeared
    EXIT_STRATEGY --> TRAILING : Profit >= 0.3%
    EXIT_STRATEGY --> DONE : TP Hit or Timeout Exit

    TRAILING --> DONE : Trailing Stop Hit
    BAILOUT --> DONE : Market Order Filled
    CANCELLED --> DONE : Cleanup complete

    DONE --> [*] : bus.Unsub and goroutine exits
